CORE
test.c
--nondet-volatile-write-model reg:observe --mmio-weak --mmio-gather --mmio-weak-depth 2
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
device observed the write of 1: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
--
Write combining (--mmio-gather): the write of 1 to reg may be merged into the
following write of 2, so the device observes only the value 2 and never the
value 1, even after a barrier. The assertion that the device observed 1 can
therefore fail.
